        <item>
            <title>1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 21:40:03 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
EWP 1.1

- Open saved apps on launch: optionally auto-apply a chosen preset when EWP starts, launching its apps and snapping them into their quadrants
- Switching to a preset now launches any of its apps that are not running, then arranges them
- Optional per-preset "Quit other apps EWP opened" for a clean switch
- Presets locked to a screen fall back to the current screen when that screen is not connected
- The window panel now follows monitors being plugged in or unplugged while open
- Applying a preset no longer freezes the window while a slow app launches
- New Email Support button that copies a diagnostics report and opens an email to support
- Deleting a preset that was the startup preset now clears the startup selection
            ]]></description>
